      "body": "This PR updates the draft with the following changes:\n\n- Clarifies the roles of Platform Manifest, Data Collection Manifest, and SUIT Manifest.\n- Adds WASM/UBI capability metadata examples for Platform Manifest.\n- Adds runtime collection context examples for Data Collection Manifest.\n- Clarifies that SUIT-specific execution parameters are extensions associated with existing SUIT mechanisms.\n- Introduces a separate UBI Resource Constraint Policy model referenced by manifests through policy identifiers.\n\nThe changes aim to separate device capability description, runtime collection context, software delivery, and resource governance.",
